# Tooltip delay (강제)

## Policy

- Mouse-hover tooltips open after **600ms** (`delayDuration={600}`).
- Open **on hover only**. Click/focus must not keep the tooltip open.
- Default **`disableHoverableContent`**. Interactive panels (fee/ledger) pass `disableHoverableContent={false}` plus `pointer-events-auto` on content.
- Do not force instant tooltips (`delayDuration={0}`) or other custom delays.
- Portal layer is **`z-[400]`** (above floating transfer panel `z-[300]` and nested modals `z-[320]`). Do not lower with `z-[200]` overrides.
- **Disabled triggers still show tooltips.** `TooltipTrigger asChild` wraps `disabled` / `aria-disabled` children in a span so `disabled:pointer-events-none` does not block hover. Do not omit tooltips on disabled buttons.

## SSOT

- `web/frontend/src/components/ui/tooltip.tsx` — `TooltipProvider` default `delayDuration = 600`, content `z-[400]`, disabled-child wrap
- `web/frontend/src/App.tsx` — root provider
- `web/frontend/rules.md` — Tooltip section

## Do / Don't

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — instant or one-off delay
<TooltipProvider delayDuration={0}>
<Tooltip delayDuration={200}>

// ❌ BAD — below floating panel (tooltip appears “missing”)
<TooltipContent className="z-[200]">

// ✅ GOOD — inherit app default (600ms, z-400); disabled Button still gets tooltip
<TooltipProvider>
<Tooltip>
  <TooltipTrigger asChild>
    <Button disabled>북마크</Button>
  </TooltipTrigger>
</Tooltip>
```
